# Remote IMAP account
IMAPAccount fastmail
Host imap.fastmail.com
Port 993
User me@citizen428.net
PassCmd "op item get fastmail-mu4e --fields label=password --reveal"
Tlstype IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore fastmail-remote
Account fastmail

# Local storage
MaildirStore fastmail-local
Path ~/Maildir/
Inbox ~/Maildir/INBOX
# Represent all IMAP subfolders as local subfolders
SubFolders Verbatim

# "channel": a connection between remote and local
Channel fastmail
Far :fastmail-remote:
Near :fastmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
Remove Both
CopyArrivalDate yes
Sync All
SyncState *
